        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `encrypt_payload.py` that encrypts a plaintext payload with a managed key, I need to choose a concrete external provider. I will use AWS KMS (Key Management Service) as the provider because it is a widely used service for managing cryptographic keys. The code will use the `boto3` library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, to interact with AWS KMS. This will make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
